 "remarks": "HEAT, HOT WATER, AND ELECTRICITY ARE ALL INDLUDED IN THE MONTHLY RENT! Charming and unique accessory apartment with so much character. Walk into a spacious living area featuring vaulted ceilings, exposed wood beams, a beautiful floor-to-ceiling stone fireplace and oversized windows that bring in plenty of natural light. The kitchen offers white cabinetry, marble pattern countertops and opens into an additional dining area. A spiral staircase leads up to a loft-style bedroom with a skylight and plenty of closet space. Full bathroom with a tub and shower. This unit also offers a coin operated laundry. Enjoy the outdoors in a peaceful, wooded setting. Private driveway for up to 2 cars. This unit has a cozy, rustic charm that truly makes it stand out.",
